  "parliament": "Trends (2020-2026): Heavy focus on Article 108 (Joint Sitting) and Article 110 (Money Bill). 2026 CDS I tested the 'Lame Duck Session' and the 'Censure Motion' vs. 'No-Confidence Motion'. Numerical patterns: Quorum requirements (1/10th of total membership).",
  "goverment-executives": "Trends (2020-2026): Governor's discretionary powers (Article 163) were a major theme in 2026. Questions often compare the President's veto powers with the Governor's (Article 200/201).",
