  "important-articles": "Trends (2020-2026): Cheat sheet focus: Art 324 (Election Commission), Art 338B (NCBC - added by 102nd Amendment), Art 356 (President's Rule), and Art 370 (Historical context).",
  "positions-tenures": "Trends (2020-2026): Focus on the age limits for CAG, UPSC Chairman, and Election Commissioners. 2026 exams tested the removal procedures for constitutional office holders.",
  "constitutional-bodies": "Trends (2020-2026): NCBC (Art 338B) and NCSC/NCST are frequently tested. 2026 CDS I included questions on the Finance Commission (Art 280) and its role in tax devolution.",
  "governance-emergency": "Trends (2020-2026): Impact of National Emergency (Art 352) on Fundamental Rights (Art 358/359). 2026 exams tested the 44th Amendment's role in changing 'Internal Disturbance' to 'Armed Rebellion'.",
